{"4893050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DinoSWORD", "steam_appid": 4893050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4893050/extras/134f4cfb07d68080034972cd12fe3139.avif?t=1785810661\" width=1548 height=1114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Adventure Mode:</strong> Follow the story of <i>5 dinosaurs,</i> each with their own adventure to complete. Go from hatchling to legend! Players start out weak and vulnerable, until coming into contact with weapons from another time, which transforms them into the ultimate killing machines!  <br><br><strong>- DinoCHESS Mode:</strong> Ever play &quot;<i>Mortal Kombat Chess</i>&quot;? <i>No?</i> Well then this will <i>all</i> be brand new for you! This mode follows the basic structure of chess; players move 5 piece types ( pawn, rook, bishop, knight, queen and king ) around a chessboard in an effort to capture their opponent's king. However, in <i>THIS</i> version of chess, 2 pieces that occupy the same space must <strong>BATTLE IT OUT in 1-on-1 DINOSAUR COMBAT!</strong> The victor gets the disputed space, and the loser goes <strong><i>EXTINCT</i></strong>!<br><br><strong>- Exciting Dinosaur Matchups:</strong> Who will win the fight, a <strong>T-REX</strong> with a <strong>BROADSWORD</strong> or a <strong>PTERODACTYL</strong> with a <strong>KATANA</strong>? Find out as you choose from an ample roster of prehistoric combatants, including species like Spinosaurus, Brontosaurus, Stegosaurus, Triceratops and many more! Each class of dinosaur has their own fighting style, featuring strengths and weaknesses in relation to other classes!<br><br><strong>- Arena Death Matches:</strong> Engage in deadly prehistoric battles, augmented with modern weaponry. Maneuver pitfalls and stage hazards during a fight; avoid ambush predators that lunge from water and use it to turn the tide against your enemies!<br><br><strong>- Fast-Pace combat - FIGHT LIKE A BEAST!:</strong> Use high flying moves and quick movements gain the advantage, dodge, block, attack from the air, fire projectiles and make use of species-specific super moves and abilities. Balance use of the <i>&quot;Special&quot;</i> meter to supercharge attacks at just the right moment. Utilize <i>&quot;Perfect Dodging&quot;</i> to leave your opponent stumbling off balance, attacking with greater power while they are exposed!<br><br><strong>- A Brutal Assault:</strong> Don't just defeat your enemies, punish them with unrelenting fury, spraying blood and gore across the battlefield. Shred your enemy limb from limb with devastating finisher moves that insult your foe for the <i>final</i> time!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4893050/extras/134f4cfb07d68080034972cd12fe3139.avif?t=1785810661\" width=1548 height=1114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Adventure Mode:</strong> Follow the story of <i>5 dinosaurs,</i> each with their own adventure to complete. Go from hatchling to legend! Players start out weak and vulnerable, until coming into contact with weapons from another time, which transforms them into the ultimate killing machines!  <br><br><strong>- DinoCHESS Mode:</strong> Ever play &quot;<i>Mortal Kombat Chess</i>&quot;? <i>No?</i> Well then this will <i>all</i> be brand new for you! This mode follows the basic structure of chess; players move 5 piece types ( pawn, rook, bishop, knight, queen and king ) around a chessboard in an effort to capture their opponent's king. However, in <i>THIS</i> version of chess, 2 pieces that occupy the same space must <strong>BATTLE IT OUT in 1-on-1 DINOSAUR COMBAT!</strong> The victor gets the disputed space, and the loser goes <strong><i>EXTINCT</i></strong>!<br><br><strong>- Exciting Dinosaur Matchups:</strong> Who will win the fight, a <strong>T-REX</strong> with a <strong>BROADSWORD</strong> or a <strong>PTERODACTYL</strong> with a <strong>KATANA</strong>? Find out as you choose from an ample roster of prehistoric combatants, including species like Spinosaurus, Brontosaurus, Stegosaurus, Triceratops and many more! Each class of dinosaur has their own fighting style, featuring strengths and weaknesses in relation to other classes!<br><br><strong>- Arena Death Matches:</strong> Engage in deadly prehistoric battles, augmented with modern weaponry. Maneuver pitfalls and stage hazards during a fight; avoid ambush predators that lunge from water and use it to turn the tide against your enemies!<br><br><strong>- Fast-Pace combat - FIGHT LIKE A BEAST!:</strong> Use high flying moves and quick movements gain the advantage, dodge, block, attack from the air, fire projectiles and make use of species-specific super moves and abilities. Balance use of the <i>&quot;Special&quot;</i> meter to supercharge attacks at just the right moment. Utilize <i>&quot;Perfect Dodging&quot;</i> to leave your opponent stumbling off balance, attacking with greater power while they are exposed!<br><br><strong>- A Brutal Assault:</strong> Don't just defeat your enemies, punish them with unrelenting fury, spraying blood and gore across the battlefield. Shred your enemy limb from limb with devastating finisher moves that insult your foe for the <i>final</i> time!</p>", "short_description": "Dinosaurs...with SWORDS!? When dimensional tears rip through time and space, refined weaponry and prehistoric beast collide! Also includes DINO CHESS, a mode that combines the strategy of CHESS with the savage brutality of 3D DINOSAUR COMBAT!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shar